# OfxGafferHost: Parametric param support (ColorLookup)
# Why: net.sf.openfx.ColorLookupPlugin uses kOfxParamTypeParametric (5 dimensions, lookupTable curves). Stock 1.5s HostSupport has no ParametricInstance and returns NULL from newParam() for parametric type, causing createInstance to fail and fetchSuite to return NULL.
# Technical: Add HostSupport/include/ofxhParametricParam.h + OFX::Host::ParametricParam::GetSuite, extend ofxhParam.h with ParametricInstance class (Instance subclass, m_curves vector-of-vectors, virtual dispatch overrides for getValue/getNControlPoints etc. with piecewise-linear evaluate, sorted insert). Add OfxParametricParameterSuiteV1 gParametricParameterSuite with 7 funcs. Descriptor-handle->curves map for describe-time addControlPoint when no Instance yet (g_handleToCurves + mutex), instance handles via existing registry. Suite func order matches SDK. Requires -DOFX_SUPPORTS_PARAMETRIC and header copy in config.py.
